# RNSBox sshd — explicit config (the rootfs overlay beats the upstream sample
# installed by the openssh package). sshd runs ONLY while the user enables it
# in the portal (Settings -> SSH); /etc/init.d/S50sshd gates it on
# /etc/rnsbox/ssh.conf. Login is the unprivileged `admin` user (password set
# in the portal); root login is closed — PermitRootLogin no here and the root
# password is locked at build time. WAN :22 stays firewalled behind
# /etc/rnsbox/openports.conf until the user opens it in the portal.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp /usr/libexec/sftp-server
